      "dur": 2.433875,
      "text": "血管里的液体和蛋白质渗出，",
      "en": "Fluid and proteins leak out of blood | vessels,"
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "seg": "04",
      "chapter": "红·单纯性",
      "start": 104.10625000000005,
      "end": 107.33079166666671,
      "dur": 3.2245416666666666,
      "text": "积在组织间隙，形成水肿。",
      "en": "causing tissue edema and swelling."
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "seg": "04",
      "chapter": "红·单纯性",
      "start": 107.78079166666672,
      "end": 111.99695833333338,
      "dur": 4.216166666666667,
      "text": "巡逻的白细胞游出血管，挺进受损组织。",
      "en": "Patrolling white blood cells leave vessels | and advance into injured tissue."
    },
    {
      "n": 28,
      "seg": "04",
      "chapter": "红·单纯性",
      "start": 112.44695833333338,
      "end": 116.16454166666672,
      "dur": 3.7175833333333332,
      "text": "这是身体为抵御损伤，调动的防御。",
      "en": "Inflammation is the body's protective | response to injury."
    },
    {
      "n": 29,
      "seg": "04",
      "chapter": "红·单纯性",
      "start": 116.61454166666672,
      "end": 120.71216666666672,
      "dur": 4.097625,
      "text": "然而战况一旦失控，也可能伤及自身组织。",
      "en": "An excessive response can also damage the | body's own tissue."
    },
    {
      "n": 30,
      "seg": "04",
      "chapter": "红·单纯性",
      "start": 121.16216666666672,
      "end": 125.55695833333338,
      "dur": 4.394791666666666,
      "text": "液体、蛋白质和白细胞外出，叫渗出。",
      "en": "These changes are called exudation."
    }
